          "type": "text",
          "text": "A driver travels from Town A to Town B at 60 km/h and returns along the same route at 90 km/h. Without using a specific distance between the towns, find the average speed for the complete trip in km/h."
        }
      ],
      "marks": 4,
      "primary_outcome": "4.1",
      "secondary_outcomes": [],
      "response": {
        "type": "numeric",
        "comparison_mode": "exact_numeric",
